OL,3,GNEWSASchool placed in special measures
OL,4,Aafter inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire secondary school has
OL,7,Fbeen placed in special measures after
OL,8,F"failing to provide an acceptable
OL,9,Fstandard of education", according to
OL,10,Fgovernment inspectors.
OL,12,FOfsted said in a report on De Aston
OL,13,FSchool in Market Rasen that "the
OL,14,Fpersons responsible for leading,
OL,15,Fmanaging or governing the school are
OL,16,Fnot demonstrating the capacity to
OL,17,Fsecure the necessary improvement in the
OL,18,Fschool".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
