OL,3,GNEWSASchool placed in special measures
OL,4,Aafter inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors said that safeguarding of
OL,7,Fstudents and sixth-form education met
OL,8,Fstandards, but other areas required
OL,9,Fimprovements.
OL,11,FA spokesperson said the school "accept
OL,12,Fthe findings of this inspection" and it
OL,13,Fhad brought in measures to try and make
OL,14,Fimprovements.
